<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ENGLAND BEAT MATABELELAND BY 115 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND BEAT MATABELELAND BY 115 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>BULAWAYO, Zimbabwe 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>England beat</p>
<p>Matabeleland by 115 runs on the final day of their four-day</p>
<p>match on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: England 334 and 230-5 declared; Matabeleland 188 and</p>
<p>261.</p>
</text>
